Z||000006||GT GT 87||10-04-2001||04:23 PM||||I had the same noise as you . At first , only at 2500 rpm's , then got progresifily lower. It is a rod bearing . I pulled my oil pan , there is a trick , and changed all the rod bearings with standard size ones . It runs great now . You should see the one bad bearing I found . I think it was ready to spin !!!!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
